        "content": "## EcoHash Chat Model demo\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Click **Open chat** and send a message.\n2. **AI Agent** answers using the **EcoHash Chat Model** attached to its Model input.\n3. Every model request is sent to the EcoHash API at https://api.ecohash.com/v1.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Sign up at https://ecohash.com (free starter credit included, no payment method needed).\n- Create an API key at https://console.ecohash.com and add it in n8n as an **EcoHash API** credential.\n- Select that credential on the **EcoHash Chat Model** node.\n- Optionally pick a different model from the dropdown; the list is loaded live from the EcoHash catalog.",
